<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= pageTitle %></title>
<meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/managed-it.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Products &amp; Services</span>
    <h1>Managed IT Services</h1>
    <p>Technology is critical to the performance and security of modern businesses. Business ICT provides comprehensive Managed IT Services that ensure your systems remain secure, reliable and operating at peak performance.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-head__copy">
        <p>Our team acts as an extension of your business, proactively monitoring and maintaining your IT environment to prevent issues before they impact your operations. From day-to-day support to long-term technology strategy, we help organisations simplify IT management while improving productivity and reducing risk.</p>
        <p>Whether you operate a growing business or a multi-site organisation, Business ICT brings together the expertise, tools and support needed to keep your technology running smoothly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-head__copy">
        <h2>Proactive IT Management</h2>
        <p>Our Managed IT Services focus on prevention rather than reaction. Through continuous monitoring, maintenance and optimisation, we identify and resolve potential issues before they become costly disruptions.</p>
        <p>This proactive approach reduces downtime, improves system stability and allows your internal team to focus on their core responsibilities.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="subsection-head">
      <div>
        <h3>What Our Managed IT Services Include</h3>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="checklist-grid">
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Up to 24/7 system monitoring and alerts</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Helpdesk support for users and devices</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Patch management and system updates</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Endpoint protection and cybersecurity management</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Backup monitoring and data protection</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Network monitoring and performance management</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Microsoft 365 management and support</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Vendor management and technology procurement</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Strategic IT planning and advisory</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="benefits-panel" style="margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);">
      <h2>The Business ICT Difference</h2>
      <p>Our goal is not simply to fix IT problems — it is to create a stable, secure and scalable technology environment that supports your business growth.</p>
      <p>With Business ICT managing your IT environment, your organisation benefits from:</p>
      <ul class="benefits-list">
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Reduced downtime and faster issue resolution</li>
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Stronger cybersecurity protection</li>
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Predictable and manageable IT costs</li>
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Access to experienced IT specialists</li>
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Strategic guidance to support future growth</li>
      </ul>
      <p>By partnering with Business ICT for your Managed IT Services, your business gains a trusted technology partner focused on keeping your systems running efficiently and securely.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="capability-block">
      <span class="eyebrow">Full-stack Managed IT</span>
      <ul class="capability-tags">
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Helpdesk</li>
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Patching</li>
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Consulting</li>
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Servers &amp; Storage</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section--tint">
  <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
    <h1>Ready for IT that just works?</h1>
    <p style="margin-inline:auto;">Tell us how your team operates and we'll show you where proactive management makes the biggest difference — no pressure, no obligation.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
